cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or code, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "Carbonation-cured cement-based products: systematic review, net-benefit framework, and reporting set — data and code"
abstract: >-
  Search records, screening decisions, extraction records and analysis code for a PRISMA 2020
  systematic review of life-cycle assessments of carbonation-cured cement-based products,
  together with a transparent net-benefit condition model and a proposed minimum reporting
  set. No effect sizes are pooled; every released value is transcribed from a primary source
  with its location recorded. Replaces an earlier release whose effect-size dataset was
  unverified and has been withdrawn.
type: dataset
